  "back_en": "Bit (0 or 1) → 4 Bits = 1 Nibble → 8 Bits = 1 Byte → 1024 Bytes = 1 KB → 1024 KB = 1 MB → 1024 MB = 1 GB → 1024 GB = 1 TB.",
