          "label_hi": "4. गलती हुई? Undo / Restore",
          "label_en": "4. Mistake? Undo / Restore",
          "detail_hi": "तुरंत Ctrl + Z दबाएँ या Recycle Bin से Restore करें।",
          "detail_en": "Press Ctrl + Z immediately or Restore from Recycle Bin.",
