          "label_hi": "2. नकारात्मक (+ not जोड़ें)",
          "label_en": "2. Negative (Add not)",
          "detail_hi": "He is NOT a clever boy. (वह चतुर लड़का नहीं है।)",
          "detail_en": "He is NOT a clever boy.",
          "accent": "amber"
