      "title_en": "6 Golden Sentence Formulas of Unit 1",
      "formulas": [
        {
          "latex": "\\text{Subject} + \\text{Verb} + \\text{Object}",
          "meaning_hi": "साधारण अंग्रेज़ी वाक्य क्रम (हिंदी S-O-V से अलग)",
          "meaning_en": "Core English word order (unlike Hindi S-O-V)",
