      "q_en": "With which royal honour did Queen Elizabeth II honour Walter de la Mare in 1953?",
      "answer_hi": "**ऑर्डर ऑफ़ मेरिट (Order of Merit)** से।",
      "answer_en": "The **Order of Merit**."
    }
  }
